# ML/DS/AI Knowledge Base - Optimized Structure

## Overview

This knowledge base is organized around technologies, methods, algorithms, and practical solutions in the field of Machine Learning, Data Science, and Artificial Intelligence. This optimized structure allows for easy navigation and discovery of information based on specific technologies and applications.

## Core Technology Categories

### 1. [Algorithms](algorithms/index.md) - Algorithmic Approaches and Implementations

Organized by algorithmic approach and implementation:

- [Classical ML Algorithms](algorithms/classical_ml/index.md) - Traditional machine learning approaches
  - [Supervised Learning](algorithms/classical_ml/supervised/index.md) - Learning from labeled examples
  - [Unsupervised Learning](algorithms/classical_ml/unsupervised/index.md) - Learning from unlabeled data
  - [Reinforcement Learning](algorithms/classical_ml/reinforcement_learning/index.md) - Learning through environment interaction

- [Neural Networks](algorithms/neural_networks/index.md) - Deep learning architectures and approaches
  - [Feedforward Networks](algorithms/neural_networks/feedforward/index.md) - Basic feedforward neural networks
  - [Convolutional Networks](algorithms/neural_networks/convolutional/index.md) - CNNs for images and structured data
  - [Recurrent Networks](algorithms/neural_networks/recurrent/index.md) - RNNs and LSTMs for sequential data
  - [Transformer Architectures](algorithms/neural_networks/transformers/index.md) - Attention-based architectures
  - [Specialized Architectures](algorithms/neural_networks/architectures/index.md) - Special neural network architectures

- [Specialized Algorithms](algorithms/specialized/index.md) - Advanced and specialized algorithmic approaches
  - [Diffusion Models](algorithms/specialized/diffusion_models/index.md) - Generative models
  - [Graph Neural Networks](algorithms/specialized/graph_neural_networks/index.md) - Graph-based neural networks

