## Key Improvements Made

This optimized structure addresses the key requirements by:

1. Eliminating duplicate content through clear organization and consolidation
2. Organizing by technology principles: frameworks/libraries, algorithms, tasks, tools/platforms
3. Creating logical hierarchy: general concepts → specific implementations
4. Prioritizing practical solutions with dedicated sections
5. Ensuring clear navigation with properly structured links
6. Maintaining focus on hands-on applications and implementation guides

